The note workspace under `frontend/src/notes/` was taken from a third party
project under the MIT licence, and most of it still is that project's code: the
editor, the canvas, the graph view and the layout around them moved over largely
as they were.

Measured on 2026-09-03, so that this is a number rather than a feeling: of the
24 308 lines the workspace had when it moved, `git blame` attributes 13 908 to
the original author and 10 048 to this repository's, and 95 percent of those
lines came across unchanged. Roughly thirteen thousand lines of the notice below
are therefore in this repository right now.

The server side of that project was not taken over — it was rewritten in Python
under `backend/app/notes/`, and nothing of the original remains there. The
notice goes when the last of the lines above has been replaced too.

